{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"ForeignCurrencies\">Foreign Currencies</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Business Create Currencies ForeignCurrencies HasWhere Is On\">The <strong>Foreign Currencies</strong> screen is where you can create and manage the list of foreign currencies used in your business.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action And BaseCurrency Currencies Currency ExchangeRate ForeignCurrencies On Other Rate To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">Foreign currencies allow you to record transactions in currencies other than your base currency and track exchange rate fluctuations.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Currencies ForeignCurrencies On Settings To ToDate\">To access the <strong>Foreign Currencies</strong> screen, go to the <strong>Settings</strong> tab, then click <strong>Currencies</strong>.</p><div class=\"flex pointer-events-none space-x-6 rtl:space-x-reverse items-center\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-cog text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Settings\">Settings</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><span class=\"rtl:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-right text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><span class=\"ltr:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-left text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><div class=\"border rounded inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"basis-72 flex items-center gap-2 p-4\"><i class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400 fas fa-fw fa-coin\"></i><span class=\"text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Currencies\">Currencies</span></span></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Currencies ForeignCurrencies On\">Within the <strong>Currencies</strong> screen, click on <strong>Foreign Currencies</strong>.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Create Currency ForeignCurrency NewForeignCurrency On To ToDate\">To create a new foreign currency, click the <strong>New Foreign Currency</strong> button.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"mt-4 ms-4 pe-8 items-center bg-neutral-100 p-4 border-neutral-200 border-s border-t rounded-ss-lg flex gap-4 shadow-[inset_0px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-neutral-300 [text-shadow:_1px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"ForeignCurrencies\">Foreign Currencies</span></span><span class=\"text-neutral-300 hover:text-neutral-400\"><i class=\"fas fa-square-question\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"></i></span><span class=\"bg-white text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-300 font-semibold rounded-md py-2 px-4 text-sm\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NewForeignCurrency\">New Foreign Currency</span></span></div></div>",
  "key": "foreign-currencies"
